Z||000017||fropuff||12-06-2001||10:59 AM||||Travis: I was wondering if you have yet tried what a 50 HP shot would be.  I mean, what jets would that be?  I want to start smaller, with around a 50 shot.  I might try the lowest, which is 37 if I can remember.  I was just wondering what you would recommend for about a 50 shot.  Thanks a lot.<P>BTW: Have any more videos?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Thanks again.||||reg||1
Z||000018||1FST2M6||12-06-2001||11:04 AM||||one question... why?<P><BR> a 35-37 wouldn't be really a 50... toss in a 41/20 and run 73. a 45/20 is 82, the 52 93, 62 125.4. the 41 is plenty safe. <P>these are NX only numbers. if your running NOS (05120) the numbers will be different, same with ZEX cause your not really adding fuel. ||||reg||1
